      "content": "breathing doesnt even do anything. it’s not just stress, it’s like... everything is just constant. i feel like i’m vibrating with all this energy and i can't shut it off. i just want a silence that actually lasts. like, a real silence where nothing can touch me or reach me anymore. everything is so heavy.",
