    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know about hotlines. i've tried. they just talk and talk and the world is still there when they hang up. i'm not looking for a distraction or a conversation. i just want the actual stillness. i want to reach a point where there isn't any more noise, no more weight, no more feeling anything at all. is there even a way to find that kind of quiet?",
