      "content": "It sounds like you are yearning for a deep sense of cessation, a true escape from all feeling and sensation. When the internal noise is this overwhelming, sometimes a supportive connection is needed to help ground the intensity you are experiencing. If immediate crisis lines feel insufficient, please consider reaching out to a therapist who specializes in anxiety or dissociation to explore these feelings more deeply. Your desire for stillness is valid, and there are professionals who can help guide you toward finding it.",
